%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: both values and overprint on one page.
% A stroke with stroke adjustment off, a stroke with it on, and a fill
% with overprint on: the page's resources hold three extended graphics
% states, /SA false, /SA true, and /OP true /op true, none carrying
% another's keys.
0.3 setlinewidth
72 500.4 moveto 400 500.4 lineto stroke
true setstrokeadjust
72 480.7 moveto 400 480.7 lineto stroke
true setoverprint
72 300 200 100 rectfill
showpage
